/-!
# The actual multiplicative singular-cochain sheaves

Complex-valued functions on the original singular simplices form actual
ring presheaves and ring sheaves. Their genuine cofaces satisfy the
cosimplicial identities. The original sheafification units and constant
augmentation are retained, and forgetting multiplication gives the
previously constructed additive singular-cochain sheaves and their
original differentials through degree three. Literal constant cochains
supply the actual complex scalar action.
-/
